<view class="page-root">
  <view class="page-back-btn" bindtap="onGoHomeTap">
    <text class="page-back-icon">←</text>
    <text class="page-back-text">返回主界面</text>
  </view>

  <scroll-view class="page-scroll" scroll-y="true" show-scrollbar="false">
    <view class="page-content">
      <view class="hero-card">
        <text class="hero-eyebrow">COMPLIANCE CHECK</text>
        <text class="hero-title">{{currentCountry}}·劳务合规</text>
        <text class="hero-subtitle">从用工、签证到健康证明，先把高风险项说清楚，再决定下一步。</text>
        <view class="hero-chip-row">
          <text class="hero-chip">共 {{policyCount}} 条</text>
          <text class="hero-chip">优先看强制项</text>
          <text class="hero-chip">建议结合当地法规</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="section-card">
        <view class="section-head">
          <text class="section-title">合规清单</text>
          <text class="section-subtitle">点击条目可查看更完整的提醒和使用建议</text>
        </view>

        <block wx:if="{{policyList.length}}">
          <block wx:for="{{policyList}}" wx:key="id">
            <view class="item-card labor-card {{item.level === '强制' ? 'labor-card--strict' : ''}}" bindtap="onPolicyTap" data-title="{{item.title}}" data-content="{{item.content}}" data-tag="{{item.tag}}" data-level="{{item.level}}">
              <view class="item-head">
                <text class="item-title">{{item.title}}</text>
                <view class="labor-pill-row">
                  <text class="labor-tag">{{item.tag}}</text>
                  <text class="labor-level {{item.level === '强制' ? 'labor-level--strict' : ''}}">{{item.level}}</text>
                </view>
              </view>
              <text class="item-desc">{{item.content}}</text>
            </view>
          </block>
        </block>

        <view wx:else class="empty-state">
          <text class="empty-icon">⚖️</text>
          <text class="empty-title">当前地区暂无合规条目</text>
          <text class="empty-desc">你可以先返回主界面切换目的地，再查看对应国家的劳务合规信息。</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="section-card labor-tip-card">
        <view class="section-head">
          <text class="section-title">使用提醒</text>
        </view>
        <text class="labor-tip-text">非洲各国劳工政策变动较快，签证类型、雇佣关系和健康证明等要求请以当地官方最新公告为准。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
<elephant-pet />
